#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.3.3"
msgstr "버전 4.3.3"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: March 26, 2023"
msgstr "릴리스 날짜: 2023년 3월 26일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:6
msgid "**4.3.3 release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4 4.3.3 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:13
msgid "SECURITY"
msgstr "보안"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:15
msgid "**Email:** Added missing TLS 1.3 support."
msgstr "**이메일:** 누락된 TLS 1.3 지원이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:16
msgid ""
"**Text Helper:** The :php:func:`random_string()` type **alpha**, "
"**alnum**, **numeric** and **nozero** are now cryptographically secure."
msgstr ""
"**텍스트 헬퍼:** :php:func:`random_string()` 타입 **alpha**, **alnum**, "
"**numeric**, **nozero**\ 가 이제 암호학적으로 안전합니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:20
msgid "Bugs Fixed"
msgstr "버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:22
msgid "**Config:** Added missing ``Config\\Encryption::$cipher``."
msgstr "**설정:** 누락된 ``Config\\Encryption::$cipher``\ 가 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:23
msgid ""
"**UserGuide:** Fixed the sample code for :ref:`encryption-compatible-"
"with-ci3`."
msgstr "**사용자 가이드:** :ref:`encryption-compatible-with-ci3`\ 의 예제 코드가 수정되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:24
msgid ""
"**UserGuide:** Added a missing breaking change in ``uri_string()`` in "
":ref:`ChangeLog <v432-uri-string>` and :ref:`Upgrading Guide <upgrade-432"
"-uri-string>` v4.3.2."
msgstr ""
"**사용자 가이드:** :ref:`변경 로그 <v432-uri-string>`\ 와 :ref:`업그레이드 가이드 <upgrade-432-uri-string>` "
"v4.3.2에 ``uri_string()``\ 의 누락된 주요 변경사항이 추가되었습니다."

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.3.3.rst:28
msgid ""
"See the repo's `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_"
" for a complete list of bugs fixed."
msgstr ""
"수정된 버그의 전체 목록은 저장소의 `CHANGELOG.md "
"<https://github.com/codeigniter4/CodeIgniter4/blob/develop/CHANGELOG.md>`_\ 를 참고하세요."
